    <technology>
      <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>The product analyzed is 1m2 of wooden windows. The process begins with a supply of wood to create the profiles and mobile frame of the window and its pre-processing, as well as a supply of additional elements such as the aluminium drip tray, gasket and paint (glass is excluded). Window manufacturing at the plant includes products, energy use and waste.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
